title: 'rcicr: Reverse-Correlation Image-Classification Toolbox'
version: 1.3.0
abstract: Generate stimuli and analyze data of reverse correlation image classification
  experiments (psychophysical tasks aimed at visualizing cognitive mental representations
  of faces). For the method see Dotsch and Todorov (2012) <https://doi.org/10.1177/1948550611430272>;
  for a practical primer see Brinkman, Todorov and Dotsch (2017) <https://doi.org/10.1080/10463283.2017.1381469>.
